OL,3,GNEWSAScam locksmith left me feeling
OL,4,A'violated'
OL,5,
OL,6,FRogue locksmiths are increasingly
OL,7,Fadvertising cheap call-outs online
OL,8,Fbefore charging hundreds of pounds and
OL,9,Fleaving doors damaged, the industry's
OL,10,Ftrade body has warned.
OL,12,FJulie Scruse, from Cramlington in
OL,13,FNorthumberland, was charged more than
OL,14,F#300 for a lock repair after being
OL,15,Fquoted #39.
OL,17,FNew figures show complaints to the
OL,18,FMaster Locksmiths Association (MLA)
OL,19,Fhave more than doubled in the UK in the
OL,20,Fpast year.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
